# --- Rust ---------------------------------------------------------

# All cargo build output
**/target/

# If you ever run `cargo install --path .` into ./bin or similar
bin/

# --- Go -----------------------------------------------------------

# Common local Go build artifacts
**/*.exe
**/*.test
**/*.out

# If you build binaries into ./go/bin or at repo root
go/bin/
*.exe

# --- Project-specific junk ----------------------------------------

# Local test media files (don't accidentally commit full songs)
test.mp3
vision.md

# If you ever stash random scratch audio here, uncomment:
# *.mp3
# *.wav
# *.flac

# --- Editor / OS cruft -------------------------------------------

# Vim / Neovim
*.swp
*.swo

# VS Code
.vscode/

# JetBrains
.idea/
*.iml

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Generic backup files
*~
*.bakcopilot --resume=*
